4. The prosecution case in a nutshell is: on the intervening night of 14/15.04.2008, eight persons of the family were present at the residence of Master Shaukat Ali (deceased father), besides himself;
his wife Smt. Hashmi (deceased mother), their daughter Shabnam (the appellant-accused), their younger son Rashid (deceased younger brother), their minor niece Rabia (deceased cousin), their elder son Aneesh Ahmad and his wife Anjum (deceased couple) along with their 10 month old son Arsh.
